sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: trigger CSMS to set a Charging Profile of type TxProfile on <transactionId>

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose must be TxProfile
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to reboot the Charging Station with status ImmediateAndResume

    CSMS->>CS: ResetRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: type must be ImmediateAndResume
    CS-->>CSMS: ResetResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = ResetCommand)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest (reason = RemoteReset)
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 9: Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of all connectors<br>Step 10: CSMS responds accordingly

    alt StatusNotificationRequest is used
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (Configured connectorId, connectorStatus = Occupied)
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
    else NotifyEventRequest is used
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (Configured connectorId, trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Occupied", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end

    loop For each other connector
        alt StatusNotificationRequest is used
            CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available)
            CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
        else NotifyEventRequest is used
            CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Available", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
            CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
        end
    end

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = TxResumed, idToken omitted)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: must either contain an identical chargingProfile as in Step 1<br>or identical from the time of step 11 onwards
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
